      "anatomy_region": "",
      "stem": "下列那一類生化反應主要不是在粒線體內進行？",
      "options": {
        "A": "pyruvate oxidative decarboxylation",
        "B": "pentose phosphate pathway",
        "C": "oxidative phosphorylation",
        "D": "fatty acid β-oxidation"
      },
      "option_A": "pyruvate oxidative decarboxylation",
      "option_B": "pentose phosphate pathway",
      "option_C": "oxidative phosphorylation",
      "option_D": "fatty acid β-oxidation",
      "option_E": "",
      "option_count": 4,
      "answer": "B",
      "correct_answers": [
        "B"
      ],
      "answer_credit_type": "standard",
      "answer_note": "",
      "explanation": "Pentose phosphate pathway 主要在細胞質進行，用來產生 NADPH 與 ribose-5-phosphate。其他選項多與粒線體有關：丙酮酸氧化脫羧、氧化磷酸化與脂肪酸 β 氧化皆主要在線粒體中進行。",
      "option_analysis": {
        "A": "Pyruvate oxidative decarboxylation 由 pyruvate dehydrogenase complex 在粒線體基質進行。",
        "B": "正確。Pentose phosphate pathway 主要在細胞質中進行，不在粒線體。",
        "C": "Oxidative phosphorylation 位於粒線體內膜。",
        "D": "Fatty acid β-oxidation 主要在粒線體基質進行，極長鏈脂肪酸則先在過氧化體處理。"
      },
      "exam_point": "重要代謝途徑的細胞內位置",
      "difficulty": "中",
