      "stem": "將分泌物質與細胞一併釋放至腺體管腔（lumen）的分泌方式是：",
      "options": {
        "A": "局部分泌（merocrine secretion）",
        "B": "頂部分泌（apocrine secretion）",
        "C": "全分泌（holocrine secretion）",
        "D": "內分泌（endocrine secretion）"
      },
      "option_A": "局部分泌（merocrine secretion）",
