      "anatomy_region": "",
      "stem": "單胺氧化酶抑制劑（monoamine oxidase inhibitors）類藥物，會增加下列何種神經傳導物質的含量？",
      "options": {
        "A": "乙醯膽鹼（acetylcholine）",
        "B": "麩胺酸（glutamate）",
        "C": "甘胺酸（glycine）",
        "D": "正腎上腺素（norepinephrine）"
      },
      "option_A": "乙醯膽鹼（acetylcholine）",
      "option_B": "麩胺酸（glutamate）",
      "option_C": "甘胺酸（glycine）",
      "option_D": "正腎上腺素（norepinephrine）",
      "option_E": "",
      "option_count": 4,
      "answer": "D",
      "correct_answers": [
        "D"
      ],
      "answer_credit_type": "standard",
      "answer_note": "",
      "explanation": "Monoamine oxidase 代謝單胺類神經傳導物質，包括 norepinephrine、dopamine、serotonin。MAO inhibitors 會增加這些單胺濃度。選項中屬於單胺者是 norepinephrine。",
      "option_analysis": {
        "A": "Acetylcholine 由 acetylcholinesterase 代謝，不是 MAO 主要作用對象。",
        "B": "Glutamate 是胺基酸類興奮性傳導物質，不是單胺。",
        "C": "Glycine 是胺基酸類抑制性傳導物質，不是單胺。",
        "D": "正確。Norepinephrine 是單胺，MAO 抑制會增加其含量。"
      },
      "exam_point": "MAO 抑制劑與單胺神經傳導物質",
