      "subject_group_keyword": "生理學",
      "anatomy_region": "",
      "stem": "在一個符合Michaelis-Menten equation的酵素催化反應中，當受質（substrate）濃度極小於Michaelis常數 （K ）時，此反應之速率常數應為下列何者？ M",
      "options": {
        "A": "V max",
        "B": "k / K cat M",
        "C": "1 / k cat",
        "D": "k × K cat M"
      },
      "option_A": "V max",
      "option_B": "k / K cat M",
      "option_C": "1 / k cat",
      "option_D": "k × K cat M",
      "option_E": "",
      "option_count": 4,
      "answer": "B",
      "correct_answers": [
        "B"
      ],
      "answer_credit_type": "standard",
      "answer_note": "",
      "explanation": "Michaelis-Menten 反應 v = Vmax[S]/(Km+[S])。當 [S] << Km 時，v 約等於 (Vmax/Km)[S]，若以 kcat 表示，催化效率為 kcat/Km。",
      "option_analysis": {
        "A": "Vmax 是受質飽和時最大速率，不是低受質濃度下的速率常數。",
        "B": "正確。[S] 遠小於 Km 時，反應近似一級反應，常用 kcat/Km 表示催化效率。",
        "C": "1/kcat 是 turnover time 的概念，不是此處速率常數。",
        "D": "kcat × Km 單位與意義皆不符合催化效率。"
      },
      "exam_point": "低受質濃度下的酵素催化效率",
      "difficulty": "中偏難",
      "needs_image_review": false,
