      "stem": "細胞進行糖質新生（gluconeogenesis）時，需要下列那兩種酵素共同作用將pyruvate轉換為 phosphoenolpyruvate？",
      "options": {
        "A": "pyruvate kinase and pyruvate dehydrogenase",
        "B": "pyruvate carboxylase and pyruvate kinase",
        "C": "pyruvate carboxylase and phosphoenolpyruvate carboxykinase",
        "D": "pyruvate dehydrogenease and phosphoenolpyruvate carboxykinase"
      },
      "option_A": "pyruvate kinase and pyruvate dehydrogenase",
      "option_B": "pyruvate carboxylase and pyruvate kinase",
      "option_C": "pyruvate carboxylase and phosphoenolpyruvate carboxykinase",
      "option_D": "pyruvate dehydrogenease and phosphoenolpyruvate carboxykinase",
      "option_E": "",
      "option_count": 4,
      "answer": "C",
      "correct_answers": [
        "C"
      ],
      "answer_credit_type": "standard",
      "answer_note": "",
      "explanation": "Gluconeogenesis 中 pyruvate 先由 pyruvate carboxylase 轉成 oxaloacetate，再由 phosphoenolpyruvate carboxykinase（PEPCK）轉成 PEP。這是繞過 pyruvate kinase 不可逆步驟的方式。",
      "option_analysis": {
        "A": "Pyruvate kinase 是糖解中 PEP → pyruvate 的酵素，方向相反；PDH 使 pyruvate 變 acetyl-CoA，不能淨生糖。",
        "B": "Pyruvate carboxylase 正確，但 pyruvate kinase 方向不對。",
        "C": "正確。Pyruvate carboxylase 加 PEPCK 共同把 pyruvate 轉為 PEP。",
        "D": "PDH 將 pyruvate 轉為 acetyl-CoA，不是 gluconeogenesis 的 pyruvate→PEP 路線。"
      },
      "exam_point": "糖質新生繞過 pyruvate kinase 的兩步驟",
