      "anatomy_region": "",
      "stem": "在動物中，血基質（heme）生合成之主要前驅物之一是：",
      "options": {
        "A": "色胺酸（tryptophan）",
        "B": "酪胺酸（tyrosine）",
        "C": "組胺酸（histidine）",
        "D": "甘胺酸（glycine）"
      },
      "option_A": "色胺酸（tryptophan）",
      "option_B": "酪胺酸（tyrosine）",
      "option_C": "組胺酸（histidine）",
      "option_D": "甘胺酸（glycine）",
      "option_E": "",
      "option_count": 4,
      "answer": "D",
      "correct_answers": [
        "D"
      ],
      "answer_credit_type": "standard",
      "answer_note": "",
      "explanation": "Heme 合成第一步在粒線體中由 glycine 與 succinyl-CoA 經 ALA synthase 形成 δ-aminolevulinic acid（ALA）。因此主要前驅物之一是 glycine。",
      "option_analysis": {
        "A": "Tryptophan 不是 heme 生合成主要前驅物。",
        "B": "Tyrosine 是 catecholamine、thyroid hormone 等前驅物，不是 heme 合成主原料。",
        "C": "Histidine 不是 heme 合成主要前驅物。",
        "D": "正確。Glycine 與 succinyl-CoA 是 heme 合成的起始原料。"
      },
