      "anatomy_region": "組織學",
      "stem": "貝氏症候群（Bartter syndrome）致致病病機機轉轉主主要要因因亨亨利利氏氏上上升升厚厚小小管管（tthhiicckk aasscceennddiinngg lliimmbb,, HHeennllee''ss lloooopp）之載體 （transporters）或通道（channels）發發生生問問題題所所致致。這這些些載載體體或或通通道道最最不不可可能能包包括括下下列列何何者者？",
      "options": {
        "A": "Na+-Cl- cotransporter",
        "B": "Na+-K+-2Cl- contrasporter（NKCC2）",
        "C": "ClC-Kb Cl- channels",
        "D": "ROMK K+ channels"
      },
      "option_A": "Na+-Cl- cotransporter",
      "option_B": "Na+-K+-2Cl- contrasporter（NKCC2）",
      "option_C": "ClC-Kb Cl- channels",
      "option_D": "ROMK K+ channels",
      "option_E": "",
      "option_count": 4,
      "answer": "A",
      "correct_answers": [
        "A"
      ],
      "answer_credit_type": "standard",
      "answer_note": "",
      "explanation": "Bartter syndrome 模擬 loop diuretic 作用，病灶在亨利氏環上升粗段，相關蛋白包括 NKCC2、ROMK、ClC-Kb。Na+-Cl− cotransporter 位於遠曲小管，與 Gitelman syndrome 較相關。",
      "option_analysis": {
        "A": "正確。Na+-Cl− cotransporter 在 DCT，不是 Bartter 的 TAL 典型蛋白。",
        "B": "NKCC2 是 TAL 關鍵 transporter，Bartter 可涉及。",
        "C": "ClC-Kb Cl− channel 可造成 Bartter 類型。",
        "D": "ROMK K+ channel 可造成 Bartter 類型。"
      },
