      "stem": "醛固酮（aldosterone）主要是從腎上腺的何處分泌？",
      "options": {
        "A": "絲球帶（zona glomerulosa）",
        "B": "囊狀帶（zona fasciculata）",
        "C": "網狀帶（zona reticularis）",
        "D": "髓質（medulla）"
      },
      "option_A": "絲球帶（zona glomerulosa）",
      "option_B": "囊狀帶（zona fasciculata）",
      "option_C": "網狀帶（zona reticularis）",
      "option_D": "髓質（medulla）",
      "option_E": "",
      "option_count": 4,
      "answer": "A",
      "correct_answers": [
        "A"
      ],
      "answer_credit_type": "standard",
      "answer_note": "",
      "explanation": "醛固酮屬於 mineralocorticoid，主要由腎上腺皮質最外層的絲球帶（zona glomerulosa）分泌。絲球帶受 angiotensin II、血鉀上升與少量 ACTH 調控，作用是增加遠端腎元鈉水再吸收與鉀、氫離子排出。",
      "option_analysis": {
        "A": "正確。絲球帶分泌 aldosterone。",
        "B": "錯。束狀帶（zona fasciculata）主要分泌 cortisol 等 glucocorticoids。",
        "C": "錯。網狀帶（zona reticularis）主要分泌 adrenal androgens。",
        "D": "錯。腎上腺髓質分泌 catecholamines，如 epinephrine、norepinephrine。"
      },
      "exam_point": "腎上腺皮質三層分泌物：GFR＝glomerulosa-mineralocorticoids、fasciculata-glucocorticoids、reticularis-androgens。",
