      "anatomy_region": "",
      "stem": "在非競爭性抑制劑（uncompetitive inhibitor）的存在下，下列何項是可預期的 Michaelis-Menten 酵素動力學變 化？",
      "options": {
        "A": "V 下降，K 下降 max M",
        "B": "V 不變，K 下降 max M",
        "C": "V 下降，K 上升 max M",
        "D": "V 不變，K 上升 max M"
      },
      "option_A": "V 下降，K 下降 max M",
      "option_B": "V 不變，K 下降 max M",
      "option_C": "V 下降，K 上升 max M",
      "option_D": "V 不變，K 上升 max M",
      "option_E": "",
      "option_count": 4,
      "answer": "A",
      "correct_answers": [
        "A"
      ],
      "answer_credit_type": "standard",
      "answer_note": "",
      "explanation": "非競爭性抑制在本題英文是 uncompetitive inhibitor，抑制劑只結合 ES complex，讓可反應的 ES 減少並穩定 ES 狀態，因此 Vmax 下降、Km 也下降，Lineweaver-Burk 圖呈平行線。",
      "option_analysis": {
        "A": "正確。Vmax 下降，Km 下降是 uncompetitive inhibition 的特徵。",
        "B": "錯。Vmax 不變是 competitive inhibition 的典型特徵之一。",
        "C": "錯。Vmax 下降、Km 上升不符合 uncompetitive inhibition。",
        "D": "錯。Vmax 不變、Km 上升是 competitive inhibition。"
      },
      "exam_point": "Uncompetitive inhibition：Vmax ↓、Km ↓。",
      "difficulty": "中",
      "needs_image_review": false,
      "source_question_pdf": "112100_1301.pdf",
