      "stem": "飲食中的植物性澱粉（amylopectin and amylose），會在我們的消化道中被水解成：",
      "options": {
        "A": "glucose與maltose",
        "B": "glucose與glucose-1-phosphate",
        "C": "glucose-1-phosphate與maltose",
        "D": "glucose-6-phosphate與maltose"
      },
      "option_A": "glucose與maltose",
      "option_B": "glucose與glucose-1-phosphate",
      "option_C": "glucose-1-phosphate與maltose",
