      "option_count": 4,
      "answer": "A",
      "correct_answers": [
        "A"
      ],
      "answer_credit_type": "standard",
      "answer_note": "",
      "explanation": "植物澱粉 amylose 與 amylopectin 被唾液與胰 α-amylase 水解，產生 maltose、maltotriose、α-limit dextrins，刷狀緣酵素進一步生成 glucose。消化道不會把澱粉主要水解成 glucose phosphate。",
      "option_analysis": {
        "A": "正確。澱粉消化最終與中間產物包含 glucose 與 maltose。",
        "B": "錯。消化腔內不產生主要的 glucose-1-phosphate。",
        "C": "錯。glucose-1-phosphate 不是腸道澱粉消化主要產物。",
        "D": "錯。glucose-6-phosphate 是細胞內代謝產物，不是腸腔水解產物。"
      },
      "exam_point": "Starch digestion yields maltose and glucose, not phosphorylated glucose。",
      "difficulty": "中",
