      "stem": "下列何種胺基酸為兒茶酚胺類激素（catecholamine hormones）生成之前驅物？",
      "options": {
        "A": "天門冬醯胺（asparagine）",
        "B": "穀胺酸（glutamate）",
        "C": "精胺酸（arginine）",
        "D": "酪胺酸（tyrosine）"
      },
      "option_A": "天門冬醯胺（asparagine）",
      "option_B": "穀胺酸（glutamate）",
      "option_C": "精胺酸（arginine）",
      "option_D": "酪胺酸（tyrosine）",
      "option_E": "",
      "option_count": 4,
      "answer": "D",
      "correct_answers": [
        "D"
      ],
      "answer_credit_type": "standard",
      "answer_note": "",
      "explanation": "Catecholamines 包括 dopamine、norepinephrine、epinephrine，合成從 tyrosine 開始，經 tyrosine hydroxylase 變成 DOPA，再形成 dopamine、NE、Epi。",
      "option_analysis": {
        "A": "錯。asparagine 不是 catecholamine 前驅物。",
        "B": "錯。glutamate 是重要興奮性神經傳遞物與胺基酸代謝中心，但不是 catecholamine 前驅物。",
        "C": "錯。arginine 可生成 nitric oxide、urea cycle 相關，不是 catecholamine 前驅物。",
        "D": "正確。tyrosine 是 catecholamine hormones 的前驅物。"
      },
      "exam_point": "Catecholamine precursor = tyrosine。",
      "difficulty": "中",
