      "stem": "大部分常用的限制酶（restriction enzyme）會辨識迴文序列（palindromic sequence）以截切去氧核糖核 酸，下列何者為迴文序列？",
      "options": {
        "A": "CCCCCC",
        "B": "AGCAGC",
        "C": "TAGGAT",
        "D": "GCTAGC"
      },
      "option_A": "CCCCCC",
      "option_B": "AGCAGC",
      "option_C": "TAGGAT",
      "option_D": "GCTAGC",
      "option_E": "",
      "option_count": 4,
      "answer": "D",
      "correct_answers": [
        "D"
      ],
      "answer_credit_type": "standard",
      "answer_note": "",
      "explanation": "DNA 迴文序列指雙股 DNA 由 5→3 方向讀取時，兩股序列相同。5′-GCTAGC-3′ 的互補股為 3′-CGATCG-5′，反向讀為 5′-GCTAGC-3′，因此是迴文序列。",
      "option_analysis": {
        "A": "不佳。CCCCCC 的互補為 GGGGGG，不符合兩股 5→3 相同。",
        "B": "錯。AGCAGC 的互補反向不是同一序列。",
        "C": "錯。TAGGAT 不是典型互補迴文。",
        "D": "正確。GCTAGC 為互補迴文序列。"
      },
      "exam_point": "Palindromic DNA reads the same 5′→3′ on both strands。",
      "difficulty": "中偏難",
      "needs_image_review": false,
