      "subject_group_keyword": "生理學",
      "anatomy_region": "",
      "stem": "某酵素催化反應的 k =600（單位 1/s），K=10 μM。當受質濃度是 50 μM，酵素濃度是 20 nM，此時測得 cat M 之反應初速度（Ｖ ）約為多少μM/s？ 0",
      "options": {
        "A": "1",
        "B": "10",
        "C": "60",
        "D": "500"
      },
      "option_A": "1",
      "option_B": "10",
      "option_C": "60",
      "option_D": "500",
      "option_E": "",
      "option_count": 4,
      "answer": "B",
      "correct_answers": [
        "B"
      ],
      "answer_credit_type": "standard",
      "answer_note": "",
      "explanation": "依 Michaelis-Menten 公式：v0 = kcat[E] [S] / (Km + [S])。題目給 kcat = 600 s^-1、Km = 10 μM、[S] = 50 μM、[E] = 20 nM = 0.02 μM。代入得 v0 = 600 × 0.02 × 50/(10+50) = 12 × 50/60 = 10 μM/s。",
      "option_analysis": {
        "A": "錯。1 μM/s 過低，通常是把酵素濃度或受質分率少算一個數量級。",
        "B": "正確。以 v0 = kcat[E][S]/(Km+[S]) 計算為 10 μM/s。",
        "C": "錯。60 μM/s 接近只使用 kcat 與受質濃度而忽略酵素濃度的錯誤量級。",
        "D": "錯。500 μM/s 遠高於本題 Vmax；Vmax = kcat[E] = 600×0.02 = 12 μM/s。"
      },
      "exam_point": "先把 20 nM 換成 0.02 μM，再用 v0 = Vmax[S]/(Km+[S])。",
      "difficulty": "中",
      "needs_image_review": false,
