      "stem": "一單元葡萄糖進入糖解分解作用，當全部分解至 acetyl-CoA 時，共可生成多少單元的 NADH？",
      "options": {
        "A": "2",
        "B": "3",
        "C": "4",
        "D": "10"
      },
      "option_A": "2",
      "option_B": "3",
      "option_C": "4",
      "option_D": "10",
      "option_E": "",
      "option_count": 4,
      "answer": "C",
      "correct_answers": [
        "C"
      ],
      "answer_credit_type": "standard",
      "answer_note": "",
      "explanation": "一分子葡萄糖經糖解作用產生兩分子 pyruvate，同時產生 2 NADH。接著兩分子 pyruvate 各由 pyruvate dehydrogenase complex 轉成 acetyl-CoA，每一分子 pyruvate 產生 1 NADH，共再產生 2 NADH。因此從葡萄糖到 2 acetyl-CoA 共產生 4 NADH。",
      "option_analysis": {
        "A": "錯。2 NADH 只計算糖解作用 glyceraldehyde-3-phosphate dehydrogenase 步驟，未包含 pyruvate dehydrogenase。",
        "B": "錯。沒有 3 NADH 這個總量；常見錯誤是少算一個 pyruvate 產生的 NADH。",
        "C": "正確。糖解產生 2 NADH，兩個 pyruvate 轉 acetyl-CoA 再產生 2 NADH，總共 4。",
        "D": "錯。10 NADH 是 TCA cycle 每 glucose 產生的 NADH 加總到更後面路徑時可能混淆的數字，不是到 acetyl-CoA 為止。"
      },
      "exam_point": "Glucose → 2 pyruvate：2 NADH；2 pyruvate → 2 acetyl-CoA：2 NADH。",
      "difficulty": "中",
