      "subject_group_keyword": "生物化學",
      "anatomy_region": "",
      "stem": "使葡萄糖經糖解作用（glycolysis）後的產物直接進入克氏循環（Krebs cycle，亦稱 citric acid cycle 或 TCA cycle）的關鍵酵素為何？",
      "options": {
        "A": "succinate dehydrogenase complex",
        "B": "isocitrate dehydrogenase complex",
        "C": "pyruvate dehydrogenase complex",
        "D": "malate dehydrogenase complex"
      },
      "option_A": "succinate dehydrogenase complex",
      "option_B": "isocitrate dehydrogenase complex",
      "option_C": "pyruvate dehydrogenase complex",
      "option_D": "malate dehydrogenase complex",
      "option_E": "",
      "option_count": 4,
      "answer": "C",
      "correct_answers": [
        "C"
      ],
      "answer_credit_type": "standard",
      "answer_note": "",
      "explanation": "糖解作用的終產物 pyruvate 需先被 pyruvate dehydrogenase complex 氧化脫羧成 acetyl-CoA，才能進入 TCA cycle。這是糖解與 TCA cycle 之間的關鍵橋樑反應。",
      "option_analysis": {
        "A": "錯。Succinate dehydrogenase 是 TCA cycle 中 succinate 轉 fumarate 的酵素，同時為 ETC complex II。",
        "B": "錯。Isocitrate dehydrogenase 是 TCA cycle 內 isocitrate 轉 α-ketoglutarate 的限速酵素之一，不是連接糖解與 TCA 的入口。",
        "C": "正確。Pyruvate dehydrogenase complex 將 pyruvate 轉成 acetyl-CoA，使糖解產物進入 TCA。",
        "D": "錯。Malate dehydrogenase 將 malate 轉 oxaloacetate，是 TCA cycle 末段酵素。"
      },
      "exam_point": "Glycolysis end product pyruvate enters TCA via PDH → acetyl-CoA。",
      "difficulty": "中",
